[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0010","text":"圆香，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0020","text":"……辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0030","text":"今天的Live，真的很棒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0040","text":"是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0050","text":"观众们都很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0060","text":"看来是呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0070","text":"大家做的演出也很热闹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0080","text":"……不去跟雏菜她们说吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0090","text":"因为那是雏菜她们的功劳"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0100","text":"当然，雏菜和小糸的演出\n确实很棒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0110","text":"但是，圆香和透……大家的表演\n我觉得也很出色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0130","text":"……Live\n一转眼就结束了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0140","text":"时间过得意外地快"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0150","text":"这样啊，嗯…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0160","text":"圆香也享受了的话\n我也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02210000_04_0180","text":"……辛苦了"}]
